# Raw camera originals — NEVER commit these.
#
# The unprocessed iPhone photos still carry their original EXIF, and at least
# one (IMG_9584) contains GPS coordinates recorded at a customer's home.
# Publishing them in a public repository would expose that address even though
# the processed images served by the site have been fully stripped.
#
# Keep them in the shared Drive folder (My Drive > Camilli Services >
# Love's Plumbing) and pull them down locally when regenerating assets.
